Dialogue: 3,0:06:50.48,0:06:57.74,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fn方正宋黑体_GB18030\fs40\an7\alpha&HFF&\move(30,55,30,85,0,500)\clip(20.8,79.2,1181.2,179.2)\t(0,500,\alpha&H00&)\t(6760,7260,\alpha&HFF&)}玛丽亚·凯莉有圣诞专辑《Merry Christmas》\N其中的《All I Want for Christmas Is You》在日本是圣诞节的经典歌曲
